# Milestone: M3
# Covers: a strand created in DORMANT state has a tag attached before start;
#         when tag.stop() is called before start, the strand never runs.
#
# blocked: T39 host-driver not implemented
# matrix-row: scheduler-strand
#
# Reason: requires both Strand.new binding (T20-promotion) and UTag runtime
# (T29 — UTag + ambient-tag inheritance helpers).  The tag-attach-before-start
# path cannot be expressed in pure urbiscript at M3.  T39 adds host-driver
# capability; T29 wires tag runtime into strand lifecycle.
#
# When T39 + T29 land, implement this fixture by:
#   ## host: create strand S in DORMANT state, attach tag T
#   ## host: call urbi_tag_stop(T) — strand should stay DORMANT → DEAD, never run
#   ## host: start VM, step until quiescent
#   --- expected output (no output from strand body) ---
#   (empty)
